  "fit": "All five loaded tiers retain110 building records,148 independent road records,the original159 raw road records,DEM,displayed terrain and water. The named bridge record is replaced (159to158), while its north path and directly connected Green Street continuation are clipped and graded. Twelve road/path width probes have actual model paving; maximum difference0.124235m reflects the modeled12cm north-walk curb, while road-center joins are within4mm. The unfiltered top ray under one guard also records its1.23m rail top; separate rays below railing height verify the paving. Coarse native bank grades,large automatic retaining faces and culvert ground cover are visible approximations. The independent Saint Francis Bridge and other mapped crossings/boardwalks remain. Failed loading retains all159 road records. Unloading releases all model/support geometry; no ground/building/water cutout.",
